        "Name": "Dire Wolf Ultra",
        "Details": "The Dire Wolf Ultra is a complete ground up rebuild of the classic assault mech, based on the already extremely powerful S-grade versions to push their performance to the absolute limit. Mounting an even more powerful assault enhancement package compared to the standard S-class mechs, the Ultra mounts multiple high power ER PPCs, weight efficient Ultra AC2s and a pair of the Societies signature IATM9s to produce a mech that can hit at any range and with devastating force. Internally, it uses an endosteel structure to free up even more tonnage, though this does mean that it had to be converted away from being an OmniMech.",
